---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title = 'Adsbangda - Portofolio Wellner Consulting';
const description = 'Portofolio Wellner Consulting: Konten perpajakan, campaign Meta Ads buat generate leads, sampai desain company profile.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} path="portofolio-wellner-consulting.html" portfolioCss={true}>
{ /* head-style slot: CSS khusus halaman ini (kalau ada) */ }
<Fragment slot="head-style">
<style>
/* ---------- CTA ---------- */
.cta{
  background:var(--yellow);padding:90px 0;text-align:center;
}

/* ---- shared inner-page additions ---- */
.page-hero{padding:150px 0 90px;}

.cd-summary{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3b3d3a;margin:28px 0 50px;text-align:justify;}

/* generic tag row (used elsewhere on the site) */
.tag-row{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}

.tag-row span{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;background:var(--paper-deep);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:100px;color:var(--ink);}

/* ---- case study: project overview ---- */
.project-block:last-child{padding-bottom:0;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img{width:100%;display:block;cursor:zoom-in;transition:opacity .2s ease;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img:hover{opacity:.92;}

/* ---- case study: tools & software ---- */
.tools-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:40px 32px;margin-top:0;}

.tools-icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px 10px;}

.tool-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:100%;text-align:left;min-width:0;}
</style>
</Fragment>



<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="portofolio.html" class="back-link reveal" data-i18n="back_link" style="margin-bottom:22px;display:inline-flex;">&larr; Kembali ke Portofolio</a>
    <h1>Wellner Consulting</h1>
    <p data-i18n="hero_h2" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.5;">Bangun Kehadiran Digital Firma Konsultan Pajak yang Profesional dan Terpercaya</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede1" style="margin:20px 0 0;">Adsbangda membantu Wellner Consulting mengembangkan kehadiran digital melalui strategi yang terintegrasi, mulai dari pengelolaan media sosial, kampanye Meta Ads, hingga pengembangan materi branding perusahaan.</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede2" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Selama kerja sama berlangsung, kami berfokus pada peningkatan kredibilitas brand, memperluas jangkauan audiens, serta membangun fondasi pemasaran digital yang konsisten untuk mendukung pertumbuhan bisnis Wellner Consulting.</p>

    <div class="hero-meta reveal">
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(244,228,9,.25);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3.5l8 4.3-8 4.3-8-4.3 8-4.3z" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 12.2l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 16.5l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k3">Layanan</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v3">Social Media Management, Meta Ads, Website Development, Company Profile Design</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(255,74,61,.12);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="3.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k4">Platform</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v4">Instagram, Tiktok, Facebook, X, Threads</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(27,75,67,.12);">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20.5 13.2L13 20.7a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-2.3 0l-7.2-7.2V4.3h9.2l7.2 7.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 .6 1.7z" stroke="#1B4B43" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8.3" cy="8.3" r="1.4" fill="#1B4B43"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k5">Kategori</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v5">Digital Marketing, Website Development &amp; Branding</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <h2 data-i18n="about_label">Tentang Proyek</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p1" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Wellner Consulting merupakan firma konsultan pajak yang melayani perusahaan, UMKM, maupun individu dalam berbagai kebutuhan perpajakan dan kepatuhan bisnis.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p2" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Untuk memperkuat kehadiran digitalnya, Adsbangda dipercaya sebagai partner kreatif yang menangani berbagai kebutuhan pemasaran digital secara menyeluruh. Mulai dari produksi konten edukasi perpajakan, pengelolaan kampanye Meta Ads, hingga pengembangan materi branding perusahaan.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p3" style="margin:0;">Pendekatan ini membantu Wellner Consulting membangun citra profesional sekaligus meningkatkan konsistensi komunikasi di berbagai platform digital.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">

      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p1_h2">Membangun Kredibilitas Melalui Konten Edukasi</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/img-js-a825defdf3ce.webp" alt="Sosial Media Content — Wellner Consulting" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc">Kami mengelola produksi konten media sosial Wellner Consulting dengan fokus pada penyampaian informasi perpajakan yang mudah dipahami, relevan, dan selalu mengikuti perkembangan regulasi terbaru.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc2">Setiap konten dirancang untuk membantu meningkatkan awareness, membangun kepercayaan audiens, serta memperkuat positioning Wellner Consulting sebagai firma konsultan pajak yang aktif memberikan edukasi kepada masyarakat maupun pelaku usaha.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M2 6.5h12"/><path d="M5 1.5v3M11 1.5v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl1">1–2 Konten Baru Setiap Hari</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl2">Engagement Rate &plusmn;5%</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 8a5 5 0 1 1-1.5-3.6"/><path d="M13 2.5V6h-3.5"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl3">Konten Selalu Mengikuti Update Regulasi Terbaru</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p2_h2">Menjangkau Audiens yang Tepat Melalui Strategi Iklan Digital</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/img-f5c7f4d240ec.webp" alt="Meta Ads — Wellner Consulting" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc">Selain membangun awareness secara organik, kami juga mengelola kampanye Meta Ads untuk membantu Wellner Consulting menjangkau calon klien yang lebih relevan.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc2">Mulai dari penyusunan strategi, pembuatan materi iklan, pengujian berbagai creative, hingga optimasi campaign dilakukan secara berkelanjutan agar anggaran iklan dapat menghasilkan performa yang maksimal.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6.5v3h2l4 3V3.5l-4 3H2z"/><path d="M10.5 5.3a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.4"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl1">196+ Campaign</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 8s2.5-4.5 7-4.5S15 8 15 8s-2.5 4.5-7 4.5S1 8 1 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl2">530.000+ Impressions</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="7.8" r="2.4"/><circle cx="11.2" cy="6" r="1.8"/><path d="M1.8 14c0-2.2 1.9-3.9 4.2-3.9s4.2 1.7 4.2 3.9"/><path d="M9.6 10.3c1.7.3 3 1.7 3 3.7"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl4">319.000+ Reach</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.2"/><path d="M8 1.5v2M8 12.5v2M1.5 8h2M12.5 8h2M3.3 3.3l1.4 1.4M11.3 11.3l1.4 1.4M12.7 3.3l-1.4 1.4M4.7 11.3l-1.4 1.4"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl3">Optimasi Rutin Berdasarkan Performa Campaign</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p3_h2">Memperkuat Identitas Visual Perusahaan</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/img-655f0c08e285.webp" alt="Company Profile Design — Wellner Consulting" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p3_desc">Kami merancang company profile yang merepresentasikan identitas Wellner Consulting sebagai firma konsultan pajak yang profesional, modern, dan terpercaya.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p3_desc2">Seluruh desain disusun mengikuti brand guideline sehingga tampilan visual tetap konsisten di berbagai media, baik untuk kebutuhan presentasi digital maupun dokumen cetak.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2.5" width="12" height="8" rx="1.2"/><path d="M5.5 13.5h5M8 10.5v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl1">Company Profile Digital</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4.5 6V2.5h7V6"/><rect x="2" y="6" width="12" height="5.5" rx="1"/><rect x="4.5" y="9.5" width="7" height="4" rx="0.5"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl2">Company Profile Cetak</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="6.3" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="8" cy="4.3" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="6.3" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="9.6" cy="10" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl3">Konsisten dengan Brand Guideline</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p4_h2">Membangun Website yang Profesional, Cepat, dan Berorientasi Konversi</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img src="assets/img/img-07f59128e7ff.webp" alt="Website Development — Wellner Consulting" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p4_desc">Kami merancang dan mengembangkan website Wellner Consulting sebagai pusat kehadiran digital perusahaan sekaligus media utama untuk memperkenalkan layanan kepada calon klien. Website dibangun dengan mengutamakan pengalaman pengguna (user experience), tampilan yang profesional, serta struktur informasi yang jelas agar pengunjung dapat menemukan informasi yang dibutuhkan dengan mudah.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p4_desc2">Selain mengedepankan desain yang modern dan responsif di berbagai perangkat, website juga dioptimalkan dari sisi performa, kecepatan, dan SEO dasar sehingga siap mendukung strategi pemasaran digital serta meningkatkan peluang konversi dari setiap kunjungan.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><rect x="1" y="2.5" width="9" height="6.5" rx="1"/><path d="M3.5 11.5h4"/><rect x="11.5" y="6" width="3.5" height="8" rx="0.8"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl1">Responsive di Desktop, Tablet &amp; Mobile</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><circle cx="6.5" cy="6.5" r="4"/><path d="M9.5 9.5L14 14"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl2">SEO-Friendly Structure</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M8.5 1.2L3 9.2h4L6 14.8 13 6.8H9l-0.5-5.6z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl3">Fast Loading Performance</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="0.9" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl4">Conversion-Oriented Landing Pages</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 14l1-3.5L10.5 3l2.5 2.5L5.5 13 2 14z"/><path d="M9 4.5l2.5 2.5"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl5">Mudah Dikelola dan Dikembangkan</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
      <h2 data-i18n="wf_label">Workflow Project</h2>
      <p data-i18n="wf_desc">Kami menerapkan proses kerja yang terstruktur untuk memastikan setiap aktivitas pemasaran digital berjalan efektif dan menghasilkan output yang konsisten.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wf-track reveal">
      <svg class="wf-connector" viewBox="0 0 1200 320" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <path d="M70,35 L600,35 L1130,35 C1200,35 1200,160 1130,160 L600,160 L70,160 C0,160 0,285 70,285 L600,285 L1130,285" stroke="rgba(21,23,27,.4)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="2 11" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="wf-grid">
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">01</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_1">Discovery</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">02</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_2">Research</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">03</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_3">Content Planning</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">04</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_4">Design</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">05</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_5">Campaign Setup</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">06</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_6">Publishing</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">07</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_7">Monitoring</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">08</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_8">Optimization</h4></div>
        <div class="wf-node"><span class="num">09</span><h4 data-i18n="wf_9">Reporting</h4></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

